Description: offline text-to-speech reader
 Legilo reads selected text, the clipboard and plain-text files aloud
 with neural voices that run entirely on the local machine. It cleans up
 text copied from PDFs before speaking it, and integrates with KDE
 Plasma through global shortcuts and the system tray.
 .
 This is an early development build with no speech yet.
